posts.body:
@Twisted Crow
I could only find one issue between the plugins which only happens when you have "Highlight On Hover" on in TDDP's Mouse Ex. However, this issue is fixed if you place my plugin AFTER TDDP_MouseSystemEx. (What happens is that TDDP_MouseSystemEx overwrites TouchInput._onMouseMove completely when "Highlight On Hover" is on.)
If this does not fix the issue you encountered then please write me the issues and I'll see if I can make them play nicely together
